                                                "sense_id": "982dd02b-20c7-3ae6-a151-2502ee9b1f87",
                                                "text": "Depending on the national or local context, these campaigns will use the most effective media and information and communication technology supports, which may include […] posters ; information booth at the entrance of a market ; kakemonos ; special events co-sponsored by the fisheries authorities and cooperatives"
